y Documents' uploads the PDF through the documents module\n  (presigned quarantine upload, scan, versioning) and links it to the resume\n  (PUT /resume/:id/document); saving again adds a new version.\n- Replaces the Actions menu with a Share button and removes the mock\n  Marketing modal.\n- Adds service clients for documents, achievements, feedback, endorsements,\n  bench summary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-12T15:28:15-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-FE-vite/commit/69e92e3e13396c16d48de9520f21390fc18a4b74","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-12T15:28:15-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-12T15:28:15-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["src/components/components/private/resume-builder/ResumeExportMenu.tsx","src/services/documents.ts","src/services/resume-workspace.ts","src/utils/resume-export.ts"],"removed":["src/components/components/private/resume-builder/consultant/ResumeMarketingModal.tsx"],"modified":["package-lock.json","package.json","src/components/components/private/resume-builder/ConsultantResumeBuilder.tsx","src/components/components/private/resume-builder/consultant/ConsultantResumeBuilderNav.tsx","src/constants/resume-builder-consultant.ts","src/services/resume.ts"]},{"id":"5c2c4dbd6ae5c0fe233eb058900eb7edd6431294","tree_id":"86d2a24ca39f6091817ba2cfa1d71db15bac1ad1","distinct":true,"message":"feat(resume-builder): real Achievement Library, Feedback, Tailor to Job, bench dashboard\n\n- Achievement Library: persisted per user / bench consultant (CRUD, search,\n  role filter, insert into resume with usage counting, AI-drafted bullet that\n  the user reviews before saving). Removes the sample achievements.\n- Feedback: persisted AI analysis of the saved resume, owner notes,\n  applied/ignored states, apply-to-summary, and skill endorsements given\n  through share links (public endorse UI on the shared page).\n- Tailor to Job: only real match data (score, breakdown, matched/missing\n  skills, risks), tailoring opportunities, job-specific summary, and save as a\n  job-specific variant. Removes the fabricated interview-likelihood/benchmark\n  panels and the job-source tiles that all fed the same text box.\n- ATS check runs on request (it is credit-gated; it used to re-run on every\n  keystroke) and saves the score to the resume.\n- Bench sales dashboard: per-consultant resume list/builder scoped by\n  consultantProfileId; counts, ATS score and status come from\n  GET /resume/bench-summary.\n- Prunes the now-unused mock constants, types and the track-outcome modal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-12T15:45:11-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-FE-vite/commit/5c2c4dbd6ae5c0fe233eb058900eb7edd6431294","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-12T15:45:11-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-12T15:45:11-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":[],"removed":["src/components/components/private/resume-builder/consultant/feedback/ConsultantAddFeedbackModal.tsx","src/components/components/private/resume-builder/consultant/feedback/ConsultantEndorseSkillsModal.tsx","src/components/components/private/resume-builder/consultant/feedback/ConsultantIgnoreFeedbackModal.tsx","src/components/components/private/resume-builder/consultant/feedback/FeedbackItemCard.tsx","src/components/components/private/resume-builder/consultant/performance/ConsultantTrackOutcomeModal.tsx"],"modified":["src/components/components/private/resume-builder/ConsultantResumeBuilder.tsx","src/components/components/private/resume-builder/ResumeATSCheckPanel.tsx","src/components/components/private/r