hub.com","date":"2026-11-12T15:51:29-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-12T15:51:29-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["src/utils/resume-builder-document.ts"]}],"head_commit":{"id":"3aa2afabef9d1514c4d4c95f4ec9a0f7c09e67c8","tree_id":"5fcb53d55295e91b7217454fae6778949f188158","distinct":true,"message":"fix(resume-builder): tolerate loosely-shaped saved resumes\n\nResumes saved by the upload / LinkedIn import paths store experience,\neducation and certifications in a different shape (no bullets array,\ncertifications as plain strings). Opening one crashed the preview with\n\"Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'filter')\" and the error\nboundary reset the page. Everything read from the server is now normalised\ninto the builder's shape (fromResumeRecord).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-12T15:51:29-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-FE-vite/commit/3aa2afabef9d1514c4d4c95f4ec9a0f7c09e67c8","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-12T15:51:29-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-12T15:51:29-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["src/utils/resume-builder-document.ts"]}}
